    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i get that the electrical stuff could be old, but it's way too consistent to be a coincidence. it only happens when i'm feeling a certain way. like, if i'm calm, everything is fine. but the second i feel that sudden surge of heat or anger, things just... react. it's like there's this buildup in my chest that has to go somewhere. don't you think there could be some kind of energetic link between my emotions and the environment?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
