    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so much more than just \"philosophy\" when it's actually happening. it's getting hard to manage. i'm becoming afraid to even feel my emotions at work because i don't want to cause a scene or break something. do u have any advice on how i can stabilize my aura or something? i just need ways to ground this energy so it doesn't leak out and disrupt everything around me.",
