      "content": "Since the physical manifestation is causing you significant distress, focusing on stress management techniques will likely help stabilize your physical reactions. Try grounding exercises before stressful moments, such as focusing intensely on the feeling of your feet on the floor. Deep, slow breathing exercises can effectively calm your nervous system and reduce the physical intensity of your emotional surges. If the fear of your reactions is becoming debilitating, speaking with a mental health professional can provide tailored coping strategies.",
      "source": "target",
